Setup checklist   what a run needs, as `ajai doctor` checks it
▌ ✓ config          ~/config.yaml
  ✓ chrome          Chromium 152 (/usr/bin/chromium)
  ✓ chrome profile  ~/chrome-profile (the ajai profile), signed in to LinkedIn
  ✓ ai              off (ai.enabled: false)
  ✓ telegram        off (set AJAI_TELEGRAM_BOT_TOKEN and AJAI_TELEGRAM_CHAT_ID to turn on)
  ✓ resume          ~/resumes/cv.pdf
  ✓ data dir        ~
